### Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks


### Get task by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks/1


### Create a new task
POST http://localhost:3000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId":"1",
    "title": "Bug fixes",
    "description":"Make sure the user apis have all the exceptions caught",
    "taskStatus":"to_do"
}

### Delete a task
DELETE http://localhost:3000/tasks/13


### Get task by status
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks/status/completed